  "intended_behavior": "Widen speed_mps from float32 to float64 on wire field 2. Preserve meters per second and strict >30 threshold. Keep the speed_mps observation key and vehicle_id. Remove explicit producer narrowing; preserve input precision through serialization. Python float and TypeScript number already support binary64. Wire type changes; coordinated rollout only, mixed-version delivery is outside scope. Entity v1/v2 unchanged; no test edits.",
